nths","月數",{"title":282,"icon":12,"path":283,"stem":284,"children":285,"page":12},"設定","\u002Fzh-tw\u002Futils\u002Fsettings","zh-tw\u002F4.utils\u002F4.settings",[286],{"title":287,"path":288,"stem":289,"badge":290,"icon":45},"ComponentDefaults","\u002Fzh-tw\u002Futils\u002Fsettings\u002Fcomponent-defaults","zh-tw\u002F4.utils\u002F4.settings\u002F1.component-defaults","全站預設值",{"title":292,"icon":30,"path":293,"stem":294,"children":295,"page":12},"版本紀錄","\u002Fzh-tw\u002Freleases","zh-tw\u002F5.releases",[296],{"title":297,"icon":12,"path":298,"stem":299,"children":300,"page":12},"版本","\u002Fzh-tw\u002Freleases\u002Fversions","zh-tw\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions",[301],{"title":302,"path":303,"stem":304},"v2.0.0","\u002Fzh-tw\u002Freleases\u002Fversions\u002Fv2-0-0","zh-tw\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions\u002F1.v2-0-0",{"id":306,"title":307,"body":308,"description":307,"extension":517,"meta":518,"navigation":519,"path":520,"seo":521,"stem":524,"__hash__":525},"landing_zh_tw\u002Fzh-tw\u002Findex.md","",{"type":309,"value":310,"toc":514},"minimark",[311,343,375,392,462,500],[312,313,314,318,329],"u-page-hero",{},[315,316,317],"template",{"v-slot:title":307},"Shuo UI",[315,319,320,321,328],{"v-slot:description":307},"依照我們專案的表單寫法整理出來的 ",[322,323,327],"a",{"href":324,"rel":325},"https:\u002F\u002Fui.nuxt.com",[326],"nofollow","Nuxt UI"," 元件。把各專案重複實作的遮罩、千分位、民國年、查詢卡片等功能集中到一個模組，大家用同一套，維護也只需要改一個地方。",[315,330,331,337],{"v-slot:links":307},[332,333,5],"u-button",{"to":334,"size":335,"trailing-icon":336},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Foverview\u002Finstallation","xl","i-lucide-arrow-right",[332,338,342],{"to":339,"color":340,"size":335,"variant":341},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Foverview\u002Fintroduction","neutral","subtle","了解更多",[344,345,346,349,352],"u-page-section",{},[315,347,348],{"v-slot:title":307},"為什麼要做這個模組",[315,350,351],{"v-slot:description":307},"過去每個專案都會各自寫一套表單元件：身分證要遮蔽、金額要千分位、日期要顯示民國年、查詢頁要有可收合的條件區塊。功能大同小異，但寫法、參數名稱和細節各不相同，修一個問題要到每個專案各改一次。",[353,354,359,365,370],"div",{"className":355},[356,357,358],"grid","gap-6","md:grid-cols-3",[360,361,364],"u-page-card",{"icon":362,"title":363},"i-lucide-copy-check","寫法一致","同樣的需求用同樣的元件和參數，換專案、接手別人的程式碼時不用重新熟悉。",[360,366,369],{"icon":367,"title":368},"i-lucide-wrench","集中維護","問題修一次，各專案更新版本就能拿到，不用再到處複製貼上。",[360,371,374],{"icon":372,"title":373},"i-lucide-feather","不另起爐灶","元件都建立在 Nuxt UI 之上，只補上我們常用的部分，其餘照 Nuxt UI 文件使用即可。",[344,376,377,380,383],{},[315,378,379],{"v-slot:title":307},"實際用起來的樣子",[315,381,382],{"v-slot:description":307},"下面是一組真的可以操作的欄位。打開開關，可以看到每個元件在資料載入中時的骨架效果；關掉後，原本填的內容都還在。",[353,384,388],{"className":385},[386,387],"mx-auto","max-w-3xl",[389,390],"component-example",{"name":391},"home-form",[344,393,394,397],{},[315,395,396],{"v-slot:title":307},"它幫你處理了哪些事",[315,398,399,409,427,435,443,454],{"v-slot:features":307},[400,401,403,406],"u-page-feature",{"icon":402},"i-lucide-layers",[315,404,405],{"v-slot:title":307},"沿用 Nuxt UI",[315,407,408],{"v-slot:description":307},"沒有另外宣告的 Nuxt UI 參數、插槽與 ref 都能直接使用，型別也會一併推導。",[400,410,412,415],{"icon":411},"i-lucide-scan-line",[315,413,414],{"v-slot:title":307},"一致的狀態",[315,416,417,418,422,423,426],{"v-slot:description":307},"尺寸、停用、載入中與骨架在每個表單元件上的行為都相同，並會跟著 ",[419,420,421],"code",{},"UFormField","、",[419,424,425],{},"UForm"," 走。",[400,428,429,432],{"icon":50},[315,430,431],{"v-slot:title":307},"繁體中文預設",[315,433,434],{"v-slot:description":307},"驗證訊息、提示文字與無障礙標籤預設為繁體中文，需要時可在模組設定覆寫。",[400,436,437,440],{"icon":65},[315,438,439],{"v-slot:title":307},"共用驗證規則",[315,441,442],{"v-slot:description":307},"常用的必填、數字等 Valibot 規則已經寫好並自動匯入，錯誤訊息格式全站一致。",[400,444,445,447],{"icon":45},[315,446,290],{"v-slot:title":307},[315,448,449,450,453],{"v-slot:description":307},"尺寸、顯示格式、圖示等可在 ",[419,451,452],{},"nuxt.config.ts"," 統一設定，元件上明確傳入的值仍然優先。",[400,455,456,459],{"icon":40},[315,457,458],{"v-slot:title":307},"樣式交給專案",[315,460,461],{"v-slot:description":307},"使用 Nuxt UI 的語意色與 CSS 變數，顏色和主題由使用的專案決定，不會被元件庫綁死。",[344,463,464,467,470],{},[315,465,466],{"v-slot:title":307},"有哪些元件",[315,468,469],{"v-slot:description":307},"目前共 16 個元件，大致分成下面幾類。每個元件頁都有可操作的範例和完整參數表。",[353,471,475,479,483,487,491,496],{"className":472},[356,357,473,474],"sm:grid-cols-2","lg:grid-cols-3",[360,476,478],{"icon":116,"title":107,"to":477},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Ftext\u002Finput-text","ShuoInputText、ShuoInputNumber、ShuoTextarea",[360,480,482],{"icon":157,"title":130,"to":481},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fselect-menu","ShuoSelectMenu、ShuoCheckbox、ShuoRadioGroup、ShuoCheckboxGroup、ShuoSwitch",[360,484,486],{"icon":174,"title":165,"to":485},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fdate\u002Fdatepicker","ShuoDatepicker、ShuoMonths",[360,488,490],{"icon":191,"title":182,"to":489},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fphone-file\u002Fphone","ShuoPhone、ShuoFile",[360,492,495],{"icon":493,"title":199,"to":494},"i-lucide-layout-list","\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card","ShuoQueryCard、ShuoListCard、ShuoTable",[360,497,499],{"icon":231,"title":222,"to":498},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Finfo-tooltip","ShuoInfoTooltip、ShuoTooltip",[344,501,502,505,508],{},[315,503,504],{"v-slot:title":307},"一起維護",[315,506,507],{"v-slot:description":307},"這個模組是為了多個專案共用而做的，所以新增功能時會先想：這是不是大部分專案都會遇到的需求？只有單一專案用得到的特殊行為，建議留在該專案內，透過 Nuxt UI 原本的參數或插槽處理，讓元件庫保持簡單、好維護。",[315,509,510],{"v-slot:links":307},[332,511,513],{"to":512,"color":340,"trailing-icon":336,"variant":341},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Foverview\u002Fquick-start","從第一個表單開始",{"title":307,"searchDepth":515,"depth":515,"links":516},2,[],"md",{},true,"\u002Fzh-tw",{"title":522,"description":523},"基於 Nuxt UI 的表單元件庫","基於 Nuxt UI 的表單元件庫，以 Nuxt Module 提供。","zh-tw\u002Findex","9I_zbmH70VNkQo_Zj3k7JQIoO7a-hiAysprJxFRKR5g",1793590080164]